---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Queued
  Queued --> Delivered: POST signed event
  Delivered --> Acknowledged: 2xx + event recorded
  Delivered --> Retryable: timeout / 429 / 5xx
  Retryable --> Delivered: exponential backoff
  Delivered --> Duplicate: same event_id seen
  Duplicate --> Acknowledged: return prior outcome
  Delivered --> Rejected: invalid signature / schema
  Rejected --> DeadLetter: retain for investigation
  Retryable --> DeadLetter: retry budget exhausted
  Acknowledged --> [*]
  DeadLetter --> Replayed: operator replays after correction
  Replayed --> Delivered
  note right of Delivered
    Verify signature, timestamp window,
    event_id, tenant binding, and schema version.
  end note
